// expect: refuse E_TypeMismatch
// A call supplying more arguments than the parameter product has fields.
// Measured silent 2026-08-18: this ran and exited 3 — the surplus argument
// judged, then dropped, with no diagnostic anywhere. `idf(41, 2)` returned
// 41 the same way. A parameter list is a product (SYNTAX §«Labeled call
// arguments»), and a field that does not exist is the positional twin of
// E_UnknownArgLabel, which refuses.
fn add(a, b) = a + b

fn main() = add(1, 2, 3)
